WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
On the Download page, choose Download free 30-day trial.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.100
Open the downloaded App Installer file.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:12.200
Choose Install and wait while Windows finishes setting up the app.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.000
Simple Office Tools opens and prepares the welcome screen.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Choose Start a free trial.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Enter your email address and choose Start free trial.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.900
When the trial is ready, choose Continue to app.
